  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Virginia Buttula is an Australian hospitality entrepreneur who developed luxury holiday-rental properties with her husband, financier Otto Buttula. Their investments began on Hamilton Island with the purchase of The Long House and expanded into a portfolio of villas and apartments. She has also chaired the Somerville House Foundation in Brisbane.",
    "html": "<p>Virginia Buttula is an Australian hospitality entrepreneur who developed luxury holiday-rental properties with her husband, financier Otto Buttula. Their investments began on Hamilton Island with the purchase of The Long House and expanded into a portfolio of villas and apartments. She has also chaired the Somerville House Foundation in Brisbane.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 50,
